                  "attribution": null,
                  "body": "I Sodi is a gleaming example of a perfect neighborhood restaurant and the Tuscan fare, from acclaimed chef Rita Sodi (Via Carota, Commerce Inn) is no joke. ",
                  "enhanced_body": null,
                  "title": null
                }
              }
